{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-98567:  cockpit security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[366.1-1.0.1]\n- Storage: Enable btrfs support [Orabug: 37464632]\n- Replaced upstream urls in documentation with oracle links [Orabug: 36528753]\n- Drop subscription-manager-cockpit requirement for ol [Orabug: 34681110]\n- Remove duplicate reference to server in cockpit [Orabug: 34030494]\n- Update documentation links [Orabug: 30271413], [Orabug: 32013095],\n  [Orabug: 32795691], [Orabug: 34398512], [Orabug: 34742876], [Orabug: 37253273]\n- Update spec file for new release\n\n[366.1-1]\n- ws: Free 'language' string also when it comes from the cookie (RHEL-244641) [CVE-2026-76235]\n- ws: don't crash when urlroot has no trailing slash (RHEL-262968) [CVE-2026-91147]\n- tls: Limit concurrent connections (RHEL-263072) [CVE-2026-91149]\n\n[366-1]\n- Networkmanager: Don't activate new network connections by default\n- Networkmanager: Navigate to details page after creation\n- Translations and dependency updates\n\n[365-1]\n- Translations and dependency updates\n- Fix btrfs subvolume mount option parsing (rhbz#2483145)\n\n[364-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_45_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[364-1]\n- Bug fixes and translation updates\n\n[363.2-2]\n- Rebuilt for openssl 4.0\n\n[363.2-1]\n- packit: Use tars for propose-downstream\n\n[362-2]\n- Rebuilt for Python 3.15\n\n[362-1]\n- Bug fixes and translation updates\n- Fix arbitrary code execution via specially crafted logs page link (CVE-2026-4802)",
